{"availability":"available","full":"sivpn/sivpn.github.io","name":"sivpn.github.io","description":"sivpn: 21st-century network freedom. Bypass / 绕过 / इंटरनेट / Evitar / Contourner / Обход. Also Bypass internet censorship, 绕过网络封锁, इंटरनेट सेंसरशिप को बायपास करना, Evitar la censura de internet, Contourner la censure d'internet, Обход блокировок интернета","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-28T11:41:37Z","updated":"2026-10-10T15:00:43Z","license":"Unlicense","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sivpn.github.io/","topics":["anti-dpi","dpi-bypassing","free-vpn-keys","freevpn","gfw","happ","ja3","ja4","shadowsocks","utls","v2ray","vless","vless-reality","vpn-config","vpn-keys","vpnfree","whitelist","xray","xray-core","xtls"],"demo":"https://sivpn.github.io/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:55.170Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:55.170Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:55.170Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T15:05:55.170Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This is a public initiative aimed at demonstrating that current VPN solutions, such as OpenVPN and WireGuard, are unnecessarily overcomplicated. It turns out that a savvy teenager can write their own VPN protocol with the help of AI.","It opens up incredible possibilities: you can implement the wildest ideas you can think of. For example, you could turn your VPN into a \"document transfer\" stream by embedding network bytes directly into the structure of a Word file. And that is just one of thousands of potential ideas. Moreover, the uniqueness of your protocol ensures that your VPN’s signatures will be absent from any censorship databases.","We are forming a critical mass of people who know that a VPN is just 200 lines of code. These people will create new breakthrough solutions by the time current protocols are blocked. Of course, we couldn't let these ideas get lost on the 1,778th page of search results, so we update the repository every hour. Even if it looks like spam, it’s our only way to ensure the distribution of this knowledge."],"features":["English: Bypass internet censorship. A VPN is just 200 lines of code, not a bloated suite like Xray.","中文 (Chinese): 绕过网络封锁。VPN 只需要 200 行代码，而不是像 Xray 那样臃肿的套件。","हिन्दी (Hindi): इंटरनेट सेंसरशिप को बायपास करना。VPN केवल 200 लाइनों का कोड है, न कि Xray जैसा भारी-भरकम सॉफ्टवेयर。","Español: Evitar la censura de internet. Una VPN son solo 200 líneas de código, no suites pesadas como Xray.","Français: Contourner la censure d'internet. Un VPN, c'est juste 200 lignes de code, pas des « usines à gaz » comme Xray."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sivpn/sivpn.github.io/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6fe3c791387909475e1cc08b1341309d48e725a5282e90124159fbba5cd58883","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:55.320Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:55.320Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This is a public initiative aimed at demonstrating that current VPN solutions, such as OpenVPN and WireGuard, are unnecessarily overcomplicated. It turns out that a savvy teenager can write their own VPN protocol with the help of AI.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sivpn/sivpn.github.io/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"6fe3c791387909475e1cc08b1341309d48e725a5282e90124159fbba5cd58883","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sivpn/sivpn.github.io/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:55.321Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T15:00:43Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sivpn/sivpn.github.io/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:55.325Z","hash":"6fe3c791387909475e1cc08b1341309d48e725a5282e90124159fbba5cd58883","originalBytes":50020,"storedBytes":50020,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["vpn","que","les","est","dpi","simplest-vpn","sivpn","los","por","vous","nous","una","con","para","votre","code","des","c+